    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sambi bada ya higa, tsukizi za mfalume Ahasuero ziriphodigirika, achimtambukira Vashiti na higo arigogahenda, phamwenga na hatua ariyoharirwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hara atumishi achimuamba mfalume, “Lagiza uendzerwe anache a chichetu anono anamwali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tsona utsambule aimirizi kula majimbo gosi utawalago, akurehere anamwali anono-anono osi hipha Susa. Achifika hipha naaikpwe kpwenye nyumba ya achetu, mikononi mwa mtumishi ariyetulwa aihwaye Hegai, mtundzi wa achetu. Katika nyumba iyo andahewa mafuha na vipodozi vyanjinavye ili adzipambe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hiye msichana ndiyekufwaha uwe mfalume, naakale Malikia badala ya Vashiti.” Maneno higa gamhamira mfalume naye achihenda vivyo hivyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sambi, hiko Mudzi mkpwulu wa Susa, kpwakala na Myahudi yeihwa Modekai mwana wa Jairi mwana wa Shimei mwana wa Kishi. Mutu hiyu kala ni wa mbari ya Benjamini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.24.10+2KI.24.11+2KI.24.12+2KI.24.13+2KI.24.14+2KI.24.15+2KI.24.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Afalume 24:10–16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.36.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Nyakati 36:10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Modekai kala ni mmwenga wa hara atu ambao Nebukadineza mfalume wa Babeli waahala mateka phamwenga na Jekonia mfalume wa Juda kula Jerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Modekai kala anamrera mwana wa ise mdide yekala ni mwanachiya. Mwanache hiyu wa chichetu kala aihwa Esta, ela dzinare ra Chiyahudi kala ndiye Hadasa. Bada ya avyazie kufwa Modekai wamuhala Esta achimrera dza mwanawe mwenye. Esta kala ni msichana mnono sana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi lagizo ra mfalume ririphotangazwa, anache a chichetu anji arehwa kaya kpwa mfalume hiko Susa na achiikpwa tsini ya Hegai mtundzi wa achetu. Esta naye achiphirikpwa kpwa Hegai dza viratu anache anjina a chichetu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hegai ariphomuona Esta wahamirwa sana hata achimpendeleya. Achihala kare vipodozivye phamwenga na mtalowe wa chakurya achimupha. Achimtsamburira anache a chichetu sabaa a kumterya kula kaya kpwa mfalume. Chisha achimtsamiza achimphirika phatu phanono zaidi kpwenye iyo nyumba ya achetu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kufikira wakati hinyo Esta kala kadzangbweambira mutu yeyesi kabilaye hebu mbariye mana Modekai kala akamuambira, asiseme bii. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chila siku Modekai kala achitsupa kota uya hipho muhala wa nyumba ya achetu ili ammanye Esta uzimawe na amanye kunaendererani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi, kulengana na lagizo kuhusu achetu a hiko, msichana kala kaweza kuphirikpwa kpwa mfalume Ahasuero hadi amale miezi kumi na miiri ya kupambwa. Miezi sita kala ni ya kupakpwa mafuha ga manemane na sita ya kupakpwa marashi na vipodozi vyanjina vya kuapambira achetu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakati wa kumenya kpwa mfalume uriphofika, hiye msichana wahewa chila aricholonda aphiye nacho kula iyo nyumba ya achetu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwanache wa chichetu kala achiphiya kpwa mfalume dziloni na ligundzure akaphirikpwa nyumba ya phiri ya achetu. Kpwenye nyumba ihi achetu osi kala anatundzwa ni Shaashigazi mtumishi ariyetulwa, wa mfalume. Hiyu ndiye yekala achitundza anachetu osi a mfalume isiphokala Malikia. Kula phapho hiye msichana kauya kpwa mfalume tsona isiphokala mfalume akale akahamirwa naye na ahende muiha na dzinare.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi wakati wa Esta kuphirikpwa kpwa mfalume uriphofika kayalonda chitu chochosi chanjina isiphokala chiratu arichoambirwa ni Hegai. Na chila ariyemuona Esta wahamirwa. Esta kala ni mwana wa Abihaili, ise mdide wa Modekai. Hiyu Modekai ndiye ariyemhala Esta achimrera dza mwanawe mwenye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Esta waphirikpwa kaya kpwa mfalume Ahasuero mwezi wa kumi ambao Chiyahudi uihwa Tebethi. Mwaka uho kala ni wa sabaa hangu Ahasuero aandze kutawala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi hiye mfalume achimmendza Esta kutsupa anache a chichetu osi. Esta achiphaha huruma na mendzwa mbere za mfalume, kutsupa anamwali osi. Mfalume achihala hicho chirauni cha chifalume achimvwika Esta chitswani, achimuhenda akale Malikia phatu pha Vashiti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bada ya hivyo mfalume achimuhendera Esta sharee kulu na achialika maofisaage na atumishie osi. Achiika Siku ya Kuoya kpwenye majimbo gosi ga utawalawe. Tsona achiapha zawadi atue kulengana na moyowe mnono. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi hinyo anamwali ariphorehwa tsona, Modekai kala anaimirira ryango ra nyumba ya mfalume. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakati hinyo Esta kala kadzangbweambira mutu yeyesi kukala iye ni kabila rani, wala kukala ala mbari yani, dza arivyolagizwa ni Modekai. Mana Esta wahenda viratu arivyolagizwa ni Modekai dza vyokala achihenda wakati phokala anarerwa ni Modekai.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siku hizo Modekai kala anaimirira ryango ra nyumba ya mfalume, Bigithana na Tereshi achitsukizwa ni mfalume na achipanga njama ya kumuolaga. Bigithana na Tereshi kala ni atumishi airi ariotulwa, a mfalume okala achirinda hinyo mryango wa kuinjirira kaya kpwa mfalume. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi Modekai ariphogamanya wamtsunira Malikia Esta na Esta naye achimuambira mfalume na achiamba kukala akaambirwa ni Modekai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na iriphochunguzwa ichionekana kukala ni kpweli. Kpwa sababu iyo Bigithana na Tereshi achiolagbwa dzulu ya muhi na habari iyo ichiandikpwa mbere za mfalume kpwenye chitabu cha kumbukumbu za hiye mfalume.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
